---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import books from '../../data/book-catalog.json';
import collection from '../../assets/books/collection.png';
import '../../styles/book-pages.css';
const titles=books.filter(b=>!b.physical&&!b.bundle);
const sets=books.filter(b=>b.bundle);
const graph=[{'@type':'ItemList',name:'Pinnacle 101 Parent Visual Library',numberOfItems:books.length,itemListElement:books.map((b,i)=>({'@type':'ListItem',position:i+1,name:b.feedTitle,url:'https://www.pinnacleblooms.org'+b.path}))}];
---
<PageLayout title="Pinnacle 101 Parent Books | Speech, OT, Behaviour & Learning" description="Explore four colourful illustrated parent guides by Dr. Koti Reddy Saripalli and Dr. Sreeja Reddy Saripalli. Compare PDF, softcover and hardbound editions." path="/books" label="Parent books" shareImage={collection} shareFit="contain" imageAlt="The four Pinnacle 101 parent book covers" includeService={false} documentOnly={true} entityGraph={graph}>
 <article class="pbn-book-page"><section class="wrap pbn-book-library-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Pinnacle Blooms Network · Parent Visual Library</p><h1>Everyday moments.<br/><em>New possibilities.</em></h1><p>Four illustrated guides to communication, participation, understanding behaviour and learning through play.</p><p class="pbn-book-authors">By Dr. Koti Reddy Saripalli & Dr. Sreeja Reddy Saripalli</p><img src="/pinnacle-pages-assets/books-20261002/four-book-collection.png" alt="Front covers of all four Pinnacle 101 books" width="1600" height="1160" fetchpriority="high" /></section>
 <section class="wrap pbn-book-section"><h2>Choose the starting point that matters.</h2><p>Each introductory 101 volume contains 31 illustrated learning pages and nine shared PinnacleAI and Verify information pages. Designed for adults guiding children through suitable everyday ideas.</p><div class="pbn-book-library-grid">{titles.map(b=><article><a href={b.path}><img src={b.front} alt={b.coverAlt} width="1492" height="1054" loading="lazy" /><p class="eyebrow">{b.discipline}</p><h3>{b.title}</h3></a><p>{b.shortDescription}</p><nav aria-label={b.title+' editions'}>{books.filter(x=>x.bookKey===b.bookKey).map(x=><a href={x.path}>{x.format} · ₹{x.price.toLocaleString('en-IN')} →</a>)}</nav></article>)}</div></section>
 <section class="wrap pbn-book-section"><h2>All four, together.</h2><div class="pbn-book-sets">{sets.map(b=><a href={b.path}><h3>{b.format}</h3><strong>₹{b.price.toLocaleString('en-IN')}</strong><p>{b.statusText}</p></a>)}</div><p>Printed books are out of stock. PDF purchasing and delivery are not yet available. Orders are closed for all editions.</p></section>
 <section class="wrap pbn-book-section pbn-book-help"><div><h2>Picture-led. Parent-guided.</h2><p>Choose ideas that fit the child’s development, preferences, comfort and access. 101 is a volume label, not an activity count. Educational books support shared exploration; individual care decisions need suitable professional advice.</p></div><div><h3>Connect with Pinnacle</h3><p><a href="/pinnacleai">PinnacleAI</a> · <a href="/verify/">Verify and evidence</a> · <a href="/leadership">The authors and leadership</a></p><p><a href="tel:+919100181181">9100 181 181</a> · <a href="mailto:care@pinnacleblooms.org">care@pinnacleblooms.org</a></p></div></section></article>
</PageLayout>
